          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"from-scores-to-the-output\">From scores to the output</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">An EBM adds the intercept and one score per feature. <code>ModelKind.predict</code> converts that sum to the output of the\nmodel: the sigmoid for a binary classifier, softmax for a multiclass classifier, and no change for a regressor. The\ncell sums the scores of the graphs for the first five flowers and compares the result with the EBM.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
