            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"the-graph-of-each-kind\">The graph of each kind</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The tabs show the text of the petal length graph for each model. A binary classifier and a regressor have one\nseries of means. A multiclass classifier has one series for each class, after a <code>Class:</code> line, and the text says\nhow to read it. The scores of a binary classifier are log-odds, and the scores of the regressor are centimetres.</span></span>"
