          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The flower has <strong>sepal_length</strong> = 5.9, <strong>sepal_width</strong> = 3.2, <strong>petal_length</strong> = 4.8. The decision is <strong>False</strong> with output <strong>0.79</strong>. The score is <strong>-1.31</strong> and the margin is <strong>1.31</strong>.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='emfo-0' random-id='d29f236c-121c-f2df-295a-aa3885a11d89'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;decision&#92;&quot;:false,&#92;&quot;output&#92;&quot;:0.7879772308897478,&#92;&quot;lower&#92;&quot;:0.7879772308897478,&#92;&quot;upper&#92;&quot;:0.7879772308897478,&#92;&quot;score&#92;&quot;:-1.3127755242621095,&#92;&quot;score_std&#92;&quot;:13.941690913176139,&#92;&quot;margin&#92;&quot;:1.3127755242621095}]&quot;' data-total-rows='1' data-total-columns='7' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The counterfactual changes the decision to <strong>True</strong>, with output <strong>1.00</strong>:</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='emfo-1' random-id='af105f62-51be-2c9b-35da-58be86da7b6e'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;feature&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;sepal_length&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot